    <h1>15 Days Silk Road & Tibet Adventure</h1>
    <div class="route">📍 Xi'an &#8594; Dunhuang &#8594; Turpan &#8594; Kashgar &#8594; Lhasa &#8594; Gyantse &#8594; Shigatse</div>
